OL,5,G2300 Death Row: Countdown to Execution
OL,6,     FNew. Susanna meets Billie Wayne
OL,7,     FCoble, once described by a
OL,8,     Fprosecutor as having 'a heart full
OL,9,     Fof scorpions'. In 1989, he pleaded
OL,10,     Fguilty to triple murder and has
OL,11,     Fbeen on Death Row ever since.
OL,12,G0000 999 Rescue Squad
OL,13,     FMore real-life drama with
OL,14,     FYorkshire Ambulance Service's
OL,15,     FHazardous Area Response Team. The
OL,16,     Fteam race to save an injured woman
OL,17,     Ftrapped in a van crushed between
OL,18,     Ftwo lorries.
